    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiverless</strong>\u00a0is a dungeon crawler in which your only weapon of defense against foes is a bow with one arrow. You must carry this singular arrow with you throughout the game, you must strategize on where and when you shoot in order to not lose your arrow at an inopportune time. This game has 10 levels featuring an old-school pixel-art ascetic made to mimic old PC games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiverless</strong>\u00a0is a dungeon crawler in which your only weapon of defense against foes is a bow with one arrow. You must carry this singular arrow with you throughout the game, you must strategize on where and when you shoot in order to not lose your arrow at an inopportune time. This game has 10 levels featuring an old-school pixel-art ascetic made to mimic old PC games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
